      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 149, 153, 155, 154, 157, 159, 158, 160, 162, 161, 163, 164]\n    low_prices = [148, 150, 147, 150, 151, 153, 156, 156, 157, 158, 159, 160, 161, 162]\n    high_prices = [153, 155, 152, 155, 157, 156, 160, 162, 161, 164, 165, 164, 166, 167]\n    period = 14\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    recent_close = closing_prices[-1]\n    period_low = min(low_prices[-period:])\n    period_high = max(high_prices[-period:])\n    stochastic_oscillator = (\n        (recent_close - period_low) / (period_high - period_low)\n    ) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(stochastic_oscillator, 2)\n```",
